{"path":"utility/tuple/make_tuple","title":"std::make_tuple","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>make_tuple","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/tuple/make_tuple","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Creates a tuple object, deducing the target type from the types of arguments.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/tuple\">&lt;tuple&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple\"><span class=\"kw1106\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tuple</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>VTypes...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> make_tuple<span class=\"br0\">(</span> Types<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(constexpr since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Creates a tuple object, deducing the target type from the types of arguments.\n</p><p>For each <code>Ti</code> in <code>Types...</code>, the corresponding type <code>Vi</code> in <code>VTypes...</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/decay\"><span class=\"kw633\">std::<span class=\"me2\">decay</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Ti<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">type</span></span></code> unless application of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/decay\">std::decay</a></span> results in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/reference_wrapper\"><span class=\"kw1075\">std::<span class=\"me2\">reference_wrapper</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>X<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> for some type <code>X</code>, in which case the deduced type is <code>X&amp;</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> args\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> zero or more arguments to construct the tuple from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple\">std::tuple</a></span> object containing the given values, created as if by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple\"><span class=\"kw1106\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tuple</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>VTypes...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1124\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...<span class=\"br0\">)</span>.</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> unwrap_refwrapper\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> type <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> T<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">template</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> unwrap_refwrapper<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/reference_wrapper\"><span class=\"kw1075\">std::<span class=\"me2\">reference_wrapper</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> type <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">template</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> unwrap_decay_t <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> unwrap_refwrapper<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/decay\"><span class=\"kw633\">std::<span class=\"me2\">decay</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">type</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">type</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">// or use std::unwrap_ref_decay_t (since C++20)</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">template</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"co1\">// since C++14</span>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple\"><span class=\"kw1106\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tuple</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>unwrap_decay_t<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> make_tuple<span class=\"br0\">(</span>Types<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple\"><span class=\"kw1106\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tuple</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>unwrap_decay_t<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1124\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;tuple&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;functional&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple\"><span class=\"kw1106\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tuple</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// this function returns multiple values</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">make_tuple</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// return {x,7}; in C++17</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// heterogeneous tuple construction</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> t <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">make_tuple</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"Test\"</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">3.14</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/ref\"><span class=\"kw1076\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ref</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>n<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, n<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">7</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The value of t is (\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// function returning multiple values</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> a, b<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/tie\"><span class=\"kw1120\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tie</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a, b<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> a <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The value of t is (10, Test, 3.14, 7, 1)\n5 7</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/tie\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tie</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  creates a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple\">tuple</a></span> of lvalue references or unpacks a tuple into individual objects <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/forward_as_tuple\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>forward_as_tuple</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  creates a <code>tuple</code> of <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/reference#Forwarding_references\">forwarding references</a> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/tuple_cat\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tuple_cat</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  creates a <code>tuple</code> by concatenating any number of tuples <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/apply\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>apply</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  calls a function with a tuple of arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/tuple","title":"std::tuple"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::make_tuple","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Creates a tuple object, deducing the target type from the types of arguments."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"args"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A std::tuple object containing the given values, created as if by std::tuple<VTypes...>(std::forward<Types>(t)...)."},{"label":"Possible implementation"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"tie","note":"creates a tuple of lvalue references or unpacks a tuple into individual objects"},{"label":"forward_as_tuple","note":"creates a tuple of forwarding references"},{"label":"tuple_cat","note":"creates a tuple by concatenating any number of tuples"},{"label":"apply","note":"calls a function with a tuple of arguments"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":311,"codeBlockCount":3}
